<title>USA: Metatec to buy back up to 10 pct of shrs.</title>
<headline>Metatec to buy back up to 10 pct of shrs.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN, Ohio 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metatec Corp said Monday its board approved the repurchase of up to 700,000 shares, or 10 percent, of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company, which provides optical disc manufacturing and distribution and software development service, has about 7.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
